15:29:43','2025-05-23 15:29:43','','pexels-photo-9654724','','inherit','open','closed','','pexels-photo-9654724','','','2025-05-23 15:29:43','2025-05-23 15:29:43','',0,'http://localhost/Ggani_Foundation/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/pexels-photo-9654724.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(32,1,'2025-05-23 15:29:46','2025-05-23 15:29:46','','pexels-photo-8223993','','inherit','open','closed','','pexels-photo-8223993','','','2025-05-23 15:29:46','2025-05-23 15:29:46','',0,'http://localhost/Ggani_Foundation/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/pexels-photo-8223993.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(33,1,'2025-05-23 15:29:47','2025-05-23 15:29:47','\n\n/* Fixed / Sticky Header with Glassmorphism */\n#masthead,\n.site-header {\n    position: sticky !important;\n    top: 0 !important;\n    z-index: 99999 !important;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.97) !important;\n    backdrop-filter: blur(12px) !important;\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px) !important;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08) !important;\n    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1) !important;\n}\n\n.ast-primary-header-bar {\n    background: transparent !important;\n}\n\n.main-header-menu .menu-item &gt; a {\n    color: #151716 !important;\n    font-weight: 600 !important;\n    transition: color 0.2s ease !important;\n}\n\n.main-header-menu .menu-item:hover &gt; a,\n.main-header-menu .menu-item.current-menu-item &gt; a {\n    color: #377A00 !important;\n}\n\n/* Adjust for WordPress Admin Bar when logged in */\n.admin-bar #masthead,\n.admin-bar .site-header {\n    top: 32px !important;\n}\n\n@media screen and (max-width: 782px) {\n    .admin-bar #masthead,\n    .admin-bar .site-header {\n        top: 46px !important;\n    }\n}','astra','','publish','closed','closed','','astra','','','2026-10-27 07:20:19','2026-10-27 07:20:19','',0,'http://localhost/Ggani_Foundation/astra/',0,'custom_css','',0),(34,1,'2025-05-23 15:29:47','2025-05-23 15:29:47','','astra','','inherit','closed','closed'